            0.212
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "If yes, then there should exist three ways of adding 1 with two other numbers to give 15. We have "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1+5+9=1+6+8=15"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " . Is any other combination possible?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
